(d)
an officer of the Indian Regular Reserve of Officers who is for the time being subject to this Act;
(f)
in relation to a person subject to this Act when serving under such conditions as may be prescribed, an officer of the
Navy or Air Force; but does not include a junior commissioned officer, warrant officer, petty officer or non- commissioned
officer;
(xix)
"prescribed" means prescribed by rules made under this Act;
